  m_text: "DESCRIPTION\nPig is a simple classic dice game. \nPlayers take turns to
    roll dice as many times as they wish, adding all roll results to a running total,
    but losing their gained score for the turn if they roll a 1 * dice count. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
